WEBVTT

00:26:29.246 --> 00:26:35.454
And that moment when I feel the
need to judge or they feel

00:26:35.454 --> 00:26:37.579
the need to cast disapproval on,

00:26:38.329 --> 00:26:42.579
I need to take a moment and realize that
there may be other explanations than

00:26:42.579 --> 00:26:43.579
that, which I would assume.

00:26:44.663 --> 00:26:46.871
Well, Franklin, Leonard, thank you
so much for talking with us.

00:26:46.913 --> 00:26:49.538
It's been an absolute honor and
a pleasure being a pleasure.

00:26:49.579 --> 00:26:50.579
Thank you for having me.

00:26:53.621 --> 00:26:56.579
Thanks so much for listening to this
episode of How to be a Better Human.

00:26:56.788 --> 00:26:59.788
That's our show for today. Thank you
to our guest, Franklin Leonard.

00:26:59.954 --> 00:27:04.538
You can find the black list at
B.L. Seek Elstein Dotcom.